The French translation file `stock_no_negative/i18n/fr.po` contains `??` instead of accented characters: for example, the "Allow Negative Stock" field is displayed as "Autoriser le stock n??gatif" on the product form.

This PR:
- replaces every `??` with the right accented character;
- fixes the translation of `" lot '%s'"`, which was `"lot%s"`;
- rewrites the error message in correct French, with the same number of `%s` placeholders in the same order;
- fixes the help text of the option on the stock location, which had been copied from the product category one (it was marked fuzzy).

Only `fr.po` is changed

Backport from 16.0: https://github.com/OCA/stock-logistics-workflow/pull/1284

Add option to skip negative qty check

@Tecnativa TT50668
